{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "481d0cb3825ab24a986ce7c7426ac78e3e238bbee31a603eda2cb01a2f8ce523", "ja": "お姫様たちの招待状", "zh": "公主们的邀请函", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3859cc840171a5f9419d671dad3fb566d7a1926b2b788a86168abd75a0e79ebf", "ja": "ふたりのエピソードに感動したという亜美と\n真美から、追加でまつりに100万点がプレゼ\nントされる。その結果、ふたりとも優勝に。\n賞品のケーキを皆で仲良く分け合う事に決め\nた後、まつりとエミリーは公演を告知する。", "zh": "亚美和真美被两人的故事感动了，  \n又额外送给了祭100万分作为礼物。结果，  \n两人都获得了优胜。  \n决定和大家友好地分享奖品蛋糕后，祭和艾米莉宣布了公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "8fce127e4a622899a1f4a51e705b2f382ce249f8a155d62afa8b534cfdce6447", "ja": "おや、本当ですね。……では、えーでぃーの\nふたりから届いた内容を読み上げます。", "zh": "哦，确实如此。……那么，我来宣读一下来自那两位“AD”的内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "a558c422c4994683db378a0b49516db8ccac4ed4dadf81e15a7b2bddab6b0266", "ja": "「まつり姫となでしこの、心温まるエピソード……\n亜美たち、メッチャ感動したよ……！」", "zh": "「玛茨莉公主和抚子的暖心故事……\n亚美她们超感动的哦……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "7f7cff6190edf32a201193087438dd219b3feea0f95a6ced9c7330726bbf0f4b", "ja": "「てことで、真美たちからの大サービス☆\nまつり姫にも特別に、100万点をプレゼント！」", "zh": "「所以，这是真美她们送上的超大福利☆\n也特别送给茉莉公主100万分！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "9dab3f23b0baddf4dd633e6eacfe7129f793da264b0a658c8e9121313bdeaa92", "ja": "ほ？　大サービス、なのです？\nということは……。", "zh": "哦？大服务，就是这个意思吗？\n也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "b69cda0593731ba421a627ae30a1e76ce6df47c39878a4e1ca4993aec937a503", "ja": "まつり姫とエミリー、ふたりとも優勝ということに\nなりますね。おめでとうございます。", "zh": "也就是说，真梨姬和艾米莉两个人都是冠军呢。恭喜你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "29fe619aa7ba6ef85b2edc06d623c8cb09c27544beebff97552898c6fc870aff", "ja": "Wow！　本当ですか！？\nまつりさんと一緒に優勝……とってもうれしいです♪", "zh": "Wow！真的吗！？\n能和茉莉小姐一起优胜……我好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "da3d4c3b1f4d9a5c1c7c3c3a9c1578252e513e20db58d11bbdf957132af8f013", "ja": "もちろん、姫もうれしいのですよ♪\nふたり仲良く優勝。賞品も、仲良く半分こなのです！", "zh": "当然啦，公主也很开心哦♪\n两个人一起友好地夺冠。奖品也要友好地一分为二哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "345ee6654193bb4f647969ae9ef6b4ca36e17ecedb0d7e1916642ae0b0376b68", "ja": "優勝賞品！　たしか、\n「お姫様に相応しいもの」でしたよね？", "zh": "冠军奖品！我记得是“配得上公主的东西”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "9a5034f2a32044e107b3d12c4e44b68196ab837f5e0c74ed9df0aac2aa73cd4d", "ja": "お姫様に相応しいもの……たくさんありすぎて、\n何がもらえるのか、見当もつかないのです。", "zh": "适合公主的东西……实在太多了，完全猜不到会得到什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "349af52db3b0700c664354e98eecfa5cdbb95c1cbcef5e5fa07b41623235d170", "ja": "それでは……\nふたりに贈られる優勝賞品は、こちら。", "zh": "那么……赠予两位的冠军奖品，就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "07412b7f99eeda9fc345f94c03a93de82ea6c6431e4381b8d1ecadff4255014c", "ja": "すずらんの三段けーきです。", "zh": "是铃兰三层蛋糕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "a0be964a2ac482765112b69d1c4f536474d055392fd14bf11c24926b255d42cb", "ja": "わんだほー！\nとっても、びゅーりほー！なケーキなのです♪", "zh": "太棒啦！\n这是非常漂亮的蛋糕哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "d48000307886090567182917f75dae68aded46bc09e221fb5f6742878344d738", "ja": "すずらんは、私たちにとって大切なお花……\n本当に素敵です！", "zh": "铃兰对我们来说是非常重要的花朵……\n真的很美好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "810f61f07e228da1df90033d9c16cc3b338cb3c51589922ccd36027cee608b4d", "ja": "シャルロットとシャーロット、\nふたりのお茶会に相応しい賞品ですね。", "zh": "夏洛特和莎洛特，真是适合你们两人茶会的奖品呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "5f01fb8cccd5efc8fada62398416c0bfbda618ae14dd2ff7ef09fcd4d8f1f92c", "ja": "では早速、切り分けていただきましょう。\nどうぞ、仲良く召し上がってください。", "zh": "那么接下来，就请您切开分给大家吧。\n请慢慢享用，愿你们相处融洽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "5f631431f0a94a034726d68ca91706eb3260d52050bd71af754fd10a6aa5ceac", "ja": "貴音姫、ありがとうなのです♪\nでもこのケーキ、とっても大きいのです。", "zh": "贵音公主，谢谢你♪\n不过这个蛋糕实在太大了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "c62c294d51443b791b4405f1d0e988bd2d9fa2bb60837ddc382cbbd42c457d84", "ja": "とても、姫たちだけでは食べきれないのです。\nなので、貴音姫も……ううん。", "zh": "光靠我们这些公主，实在吃不完。  \n所以，贵音公主也……不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "f589b6bed7337dcf0d7c639bc6af960078a314f080e774dc1f66c7590bf54782", "ja": "貴音姫も、亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃんも、\n姫たちと一緒に食べるのです。……ね？", "zh": "贵音公主、亚美和真美，也要和我们这些公主一起吃。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "1a83daf1f7d59c67e5e4d05bc137fb7f67b66d30a65ca401ec0a3a8834335f8e", "ja": "そうですね！　貴音さま、亜美さん、真美さん。\n私たちと一緒に、楽しみましょう♪", "zh": "是啊！贵音大人、亚美、真美。\n和我们一起享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "98af7dee8650c9384a8185ed5f92769cd2b67dbf779871d14ef35cd4670a35bd", "ja": "ありがとうございます。ではお言葉に甘えて、\n私たちもご相伴にあずからせていただきましょう。", "zh": "十分感谢。那么我们便恭敬不如从命，\n一起共享这份美意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "60675be2501d9455b98cafe4ddba22803ab0b195ccb508e08d84ac49c211f6b7", "ja": "さて。『Afternoon Tea Party』も\nいよいよ終了のお時間がやってまいりました。", "zh": "那么，《Afternoon Tea Party》也终于要到结束的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "fc1f4584a1fd55871534f6c473a53112346bd02efc47634f3ac951c8e534ef04", "ja": "もう終わってしまうんですね……。\n楽しい時間は、あっという間です。", "zh": "这么快就要结束了呢……\n快乐的时光总是转瞬即逝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "ea27d4344cf3213a059f7a3faaf090745626f211c34a1a64c6c0fce1519e0a2e", "ja": "それにガーデンカフェも、とっても素敵だったのです。\nまたみんなで、お姫様のお茶会をしたいのです♪", "zh": "而且，花园咖啡馆也特别棒呢。\n下次还想和大家一起举办公主茶会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "7eb62869c74016437fde67b19c9b169947690726b4db4a1e0392791625da105b", "ja": "はい！　次は劇場のみなさんをお誘いして、\n一緒に来たいと思います♪", "zh": "好的！下次我想邀请剧场的大家，一起过来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "501d8dc3228e0585f820df9c47ad0425a8722344fd1c5350c44aabe03a9c582c", "ja": "番組は、いよいよ終わりとなりますが……。\nここでふたりから、大切なお知らせがあります。", "zh": "节目终于要结束了，不过……接下来，我们两人有一则重要通知要宣布。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "dd0c2d89e6ea29a622f760852381dfcb22cd553bdb483123119d575fd383808f", "ja": "なんと、『Charlotte・Charlotte』の\nリバイバル公演の開催が決定したのです！", "zh": "没想到，《Charlotte・Charlotte》的复出演出决定举办了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "bb3ecd36ea1bcfa141740cdf669118db3f930ce4c4ebe29ff8b3ea49afd530da", "ja": "どうかみなさん、楽しみにしていてくださいね♪", "zh": "请大家务必期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "efff425746f65c91d0f6f3b718995db6ffbc97bafaf8c89679156c6dc35b633b", "ja": "それでは、最後に……。\nシャルロット、準備はいい？", "zh": "那么，最后……夏洛特，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "4e809683bf79a7e261d06171a945bc790fba49156d28c8f7ccd96466fc71bb3d", "ja": "もちろん！　私たち、またお茶会ができるのね。\nたくさんお客さんを招いて、きっとにぎやかになるわ。", "zh": "当然啦！我们又能举办茶会了呢。\n邀请很多客人来，一定会变得很热闹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "15ffc23ff0ccfd75b157fe9bf3515a9776111ef145e7302f62d9ece9991d0bcf", "ja": "ええ、そうね！　お茶とお菓子をいっぱい用意して、\n楽しく過ごしましょう！", "zh": "嗯，没错！准备好满满的茶水和点心，一起开心地度过吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "f289cf6eecbe8ac472afc1fde2c99bd11d1f2c4854f6a3537a28af764d442efd", "ja": "私、ずっと待っていたのよ。\nまるで魔法のような、あの時間の続きを！", "zh": "我一直在等待着呢。\n等待那段如魔法般的时光，继续延续下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "3eda246386ad0b058bf64e9615d06f987a6c97c4f5119e9a78e3e42b17739740", "ja": "さぁ。お茶会を始めましょう？", "zh": "来吧。茶会差不多该开始了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_04_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "3eda246386ad0b058bf64e9615d06f987a6c97c4f5119e9a78e3e42b17739740", "ja": "さぁ。お茶会を始めましょう？", "zh": "来吧。茶会差不多该开始了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
